#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cz_hr_payroll_base.field_hr_version__l10n_cz_social_discount_category
msgid ""
"Eligibility category for the 5 % employer social-insurance discount (§7a of "
"Act 589/1992). The discount applies only for a shorter working time of 8-30 "
"h/week (except employees under 21) with a monthly assessment base up to 1.5x"
" the average wage. Only one employer may claim it per employee; the intent "
"must be notified to ČSSZ."
msgstr ""

