"Wage compensation for částečná nezaměstnanost (§ 209 of the Labour Code), as"
" a percentage of average earnings. Without an agreement with the trade "
"union, or an internal regulation where there is no union, it is a jiná "
"překážka na straně zaměstnavatele under § 208 and paid in full: leave 100 %."
" Enter the agreed rate only when such an agreement or regulation exists; "
"payslips never pay less than the statutory minimum of 60 %."
msgstr ""

